is_a: CL:4030065 ! L6 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron

[Term]
id: CL:4072042
name: L5/6 near-projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens)
def: "A transcriptomically defined near-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in cortical layer 5/6 in humans." [https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/d01c9dff-abd1-4825-bf30-2eb2ba74597e.cxg/, PMID:34004146, PMID:37292694, PMID:37824655]
